__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
data/
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
.pytest_cache/
registry.json
memory/*
!memory/.gitkeep
projects/*
!projects/.gitkeep
agents/*
!agents/.gitkeep

# Working notes (backlogs, audits, plans, ops notes) accumulate as ad-hoc *.md at
# the repo root. Ignore root-level markdown by default and opt in what ships.
# Covers CLAUDE.md, BACKLOG.md, OPUS-PLAN.md and anything like them.
#
# NOTE the leading slash — it anchors this to the root ONLY, and that is
# load-bearing. Nested markdown is runtime data, not documentation: the registry
# loads tools/<name>/TOOL.md at startup, agents/<slug>/AGENT.md and
# skills/<name>/SKILL.md the same way, and the self_docs tool serves docs/SELF.md.
# A blanket `*.md` would ship a Pi that has no tools. Don't remove the slash.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/SECURITY-RESIDUAL-RISK.md

# vendored external research dump (Claude Code source study) — huge, not ours
collection-claude-code-source-code/
